Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: asusctl
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/OpenGamingCollective/asusctl/issues
Source: https://github.com/OpenGamingCollective/asusctl
Comment:
 The source package carries two trees: the program (the release tarball) and
 vendor/ (the crates from Cargo.lock, shipped as the component "vendor" so the
 build needs no network). The Files paragraphs for vendor/ are generated by
 scripts/vendor-copyright.py from each crate's Cargo.toml license field; each
 crate's copyright holders are the authors named in that crate's Cargo.toml
 and the license files inside the crate's directory.
 .
 vendor/ also carries the crates of the ROG Control Center GUI, which this
 package does not build; Slint is redistributed under its GPL-3 option.

